                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Come September, members of Congress will return to Washington after the long August recess to debate the future of America\u2019s safety net and most effective anti-poverty tool, the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP), hangs in the balance.\n\nFor six decades, the program has provided a crucial lifeline to low-income Americans trying to make ends meet. As a member of the agriculture committee, I pledge to work with my fellow democrats and colleagues across the isle to maintain SNAP and continue to help our neighbors and prevent vulnerable Americans from falling through the cracks.",
